Package: ceakit
Type: Package
Title: Toolkit for Decision Modelling and Cost-Effectiveness Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Maryam", "Hussain", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "hussain.maryamr@gmail.com")
Description: Reusable building blocks for health economic decision models:
    parameter tables with distributions and sources, input validation,
    decision-tree and cohort Markov engines with competing risks, probabilistic
    and one-way sensitivity analysis, scenarios, incremental analysis with
    dominance, acceptability curves, value of information (EVPI, EVPPI),
    standard tables and plots, export, a generic Shiny app, and a project
    template so every analysis follows the same structure.
